urrentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle data-dc-tpl=\"410\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path data-dc-tpl=\"411\" d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg><span data-dc-tpl=\"412\" class=\"cap\">clock</span></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"413\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 w-20\"><svg data-dc-tpl=\"414\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect data-dc-tpl=\"415\" x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path data-dc-tpl=\"416\" d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"></path></svg><span data-dc-tpl=\"417\" class=\"cap\">lock</span></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"418\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 w-20\"><svg data-dc-tpl=\"419\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path data-dc-tpl=\"420\" d=\"M4 8h3l2-3h6l2 3h3v11H4z\"></path><circle data-dc-tpl=\"421\" cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span data-dc-tpl=\"422\" class=\"cap\">camera</span></span><span data-dc-tpl=\"423\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 w-20\"><svg data-dc-tpl=\"424\" class=\"w-6 h-6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path data-dc-tpl=\"425\" d=\"M4 7h13l-3-3M20 17H7l3 3\"></path></svg><span data-dc-tpl=\"426\" class=\"cap\">swap</span></span></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"427\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"428\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"429\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-7 font-bold\">08 · Quy tắc</h2><ul data-dc-tpl=\"430\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-muted list-disc pl-5\"><li data-dc-tpl=\"431\">Một màn, một hành động chính: nút .btn full-width ở đáy, màu brand.blue. Hành động phá hủy (nghỉ học, khóa) dùng brand.orange.</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"432\">Không viền card. Phân cấp bằng nền: surface → white → soft.* → brand.</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"433\">Trạng thái luôn là .pill 2 chữ, màu theo ý nghĩa, không chỉ dựa vào màu (có chữ kèm).</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"434\">Học sinh có ảnh minh họa; nhân sự dùng .initials cho đến khi có ảnh thật.</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"435\">Dropdown mở bằng bottom sheet bo 28 (xem GV05·s2, s3). Gợi ý tìm kiếm mở ngay dưới ô nhập (GV05·s1).</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"436\">Không vẽ status bar giả. Nội dung bắt đầu ở 56 px, tab bar nổi cách đáy 24 px.</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"437\">Họa tiết: hình học trừu tượng, không dùng nhân vật. Gồm vòng tròn mảnh trắng 8%, lưới chấm trắng 14%, đường cong gradient vàng sang đỏ lấy từ logo. Chỉ dùng ở màn chào và trạng thái trống.</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"438\">Logo có chữ trắng: luôn đặt trên nền brand.blue.</li></ul></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"439\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"440\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-7 font-bold\">09 · Bàn giao dev</h2><div data-dc-tpl=\"441\" class=\"card bg-surface font-mono text-sm leading-6 flex flex-col\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"442\">project/tailwind.config.js · tokens màu, font, radius, shadow</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"443\">project/tailwind.src.css · 24 component class (@layer components)</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"444\">project/tailwind.css · bản build minified</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"445\">project/*.dc.html · 28 màn, markup Tailwind thuần</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"446\">Font: fonts.googleapis.com · Google Sans Flex 300–800</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"447\">Logo, avatar: xuất từ Assets của canvas</span></div><span data-dc-tpl=\"448\" class=\"cap\">Flutter: map token sang ThemeData (colorScheme.primary = brand.blue, surface = surface, error = brand.orange) và TextTheme theo bảng 02.</span></div></section></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n","bodyClass":"mh-reference","styles":"\n    .sc-placeholder{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent);\n      border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}\n    @keyframes sc-shine{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder,\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing{position:relative;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 5%,transparent);\n      border-color:transparent}\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder::before,\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing::before{content:'';\n      position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,119,87,0) 25%,rgba(247,225,211,.95) 37%,rgba(217,119,87,0) 63%);\n      background-size:400% 100%;animation:sc-shine 1.4s ease infinite}\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-placeholder)::before,\n    :host.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-interp.sc-missing)::before{animation:none;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}\n    .sc-placeholder-error{padding:4px 8px;font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 70%,transparent);word-break:break-word}\n    .sc-interp.sc-missing{display:inline-block;width:2em;height:1em;overflow:hidden;\n      vertical-align:text-bottom;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;\n      user-select:none}\n    .sc-interp.sc-unresolved{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.85em;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);border-radius:3px;\n      padding:0 3px}\n    .sc-host.sc-has-error{position:relative}\n    .sc-logic-error{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:60ch;\n      padding:6px 10px;background:#b00020;color:#fff;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap;pointer-events:none}\n    /* Mirrors PRINT_BASELINE_CSS in apps/web deck-stage-export.ts — keep both\n       in sync until dc-runtime regains a build step. */\n    @media print {\n      @page { margin: 0.5cm; }\n      figure, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n      #dc-root, #dc-root > .sc-host { height: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after {\n        print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n        backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n        animation-delay: -99s !important; animation-duration: .001s !important;\n        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; animation-fill-mode: both !important;\n        animation-play-state: running !important; transition-duration: 0s !important;\n      }\n    }\n  \nx-dc{display:none!important}\n.static-root{margin:0}","text":4051}